    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics feels like a bridge—it connects logic and creativity for me, especially since I enjoy problem-solving like photography does, but in numbers instead of pixels. Though my vocational training didn’t focus on deep theory, I find its precision refreshing, like the structure in literature that requires careful reading.",
